<\body>
  <\quote-env>
    \ \ \ \ \ \ 检验文字：

    表应具有自明性。为使表格简洁易读，尽可能采用三线表，如表table:1-1所示是x00;小表格x00;。三条线可以先选中第一行，在工具栏倒数第五个按钮设置双线的边界，然后同理选中最后一行，设置单线边界。

    <small-table|<tabular|<tformat|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-bborder|1ln>|<cwith|2|2|1|-1|cell-tborder|1ln>|<cwith|6|6|1|-1|cell-tborder|0ln>|<cwith|5|5|1|-1|cell-bborder|0ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-height|2em>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-vmode|exact>|<cwith|2|-1|1|-1|cell-height|2em>|<cwith|2|-1|1|-1|cell-vmode|exact>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-valign|c>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-tborder|2ln>|<cwith|6|6|1|-1|cell-bborder|2ln>|<cwith|1|-1|1|1|cell-lborder|0ln>|<cwith|1|-1|2|2|cell-rborder|0ln>|<table|<row|<cell|文件名>|<cell|描述>>|<row|<cell|thuthesis.dtx>|<cell|模板的源文件，包括文档和注释>>|<row|<cell|thuthesis.cls>|<cell|模板文件>>|<row|<cell|thuthesis-*.bst>|<cell|BibTeX 参考文献表样式文件>>|<row|<cell|thuthesis-*.bbx>|<cell|BibLaTeX 参考文献表样式文件>>|<row|<cell|thuthesis-*.cbx>|<cell|BibLaTeX 引用样式文件>>>>><label|table:1-1>|三线表示例>

    表格如果需要注释，可以在文本后面点击 x00;插入\<rightarrow\>外观标记\<rightarrow\>上标x00;，然后在表格下方写注释，参考表table:2-2。

    <\big-table>
      <tabular|<tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|1|cell-width|2cm>|<cwith|1|-1|1|1|cell-hmode|exact>|<cwith|2|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|c>|<cwith|1|-1|1|1|cell-halign|c>|<cwith|1|-1|2|2|cell-width|4cm>|<cwith|1|-1|2|2|cell-hmode|exact>|<cwith|1|-1|2|2|cell-halign|l>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-valign|t>|<cwith|1|-1|3|3|cell-halign|r>|<cwith|1|-1|3|3|cell-width|6cm>|<cwith|1|-1|3|3|cell-hmode|exact>|<cwith|2|2|3|3|cell-halign|r>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-tborder|2ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|1|cell-lborder|0ln>|<cwith|1|1|3|3|cell-rborder|0ln>|<cwith|2|2|1|-1|cell-tborder|1ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-bborder|1ln>|<cwith|2|2|1|1|cell-lborder|0ln>|<cwith|2|2|3|3|cell-rborder|0ln>|<cwith|3|3|1|-1|cell-tborder|0ln>|<cwith|2|2|1|-1|cell-bborder|0ln>|<cwith|3|3|1|-1|cell-bborder|2ln>|<cwith|3|3|1|1|cell-lborder|0ln>|<cwith|3|3|3|3|cell-rborder|0ln>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-height|>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-vmode|auto>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-height|2em>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-vmode|exact>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-valign|c>|<cwith|2|-1|1|-1|cell-valign|t>|<cwith|2|-1|1|-1|cell-bsep|0.5fn>|<cwith|2|-1|1|-1|cell-tsep|0.5fn>|<table|<row|<cell|2cm>|<cell|4cm>|<cell|6cm>>|<row|<\cell>
        左右居中2cm宽度<hover-balloon|||left|Bottom><rsup|a>
      </cell>|<\cell>
        左右居左4cm宽度
      </cell>|<\cell>
        左右居右6cm宽度
      </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
        左右居中2cm宽度<hover-balloon|||left|Bottom><rsup|b>
      </cell>|<\cell>
        左右居左4cm宽度左右居左4cm宽度
      </cell>|<\cell>
        左右居右6cm宽度左右居右 6cm宽度
      </cell>>>>><label|table:2-2>

      \;

      <hover-balloon|||left|Bottom><hover-balloon||阿斯顿|left|Bottom><hover-balloon|||left|Bottom><rsup|a> A的注释

      <rsup|b> B的注释
    <|big-table>
      带附注以及调整列宽的的表格示例
    </big-table>

    如果需要调整表格列宽度，直接在工具栏点击修改即可。

    表格如果想要与页面等宽，插入标宽无框表格再修改，如表格table:2-3所示。

    <\big-table|<wide-tabular|<tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-tborder|1ln>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-bborder|1ln>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-lborder|0ln>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-rborder|0ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-tborder|2ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|1|cell-lborder|0ln>|<cwith|1|1|4|4|cell-rborder|0ln>|<cwith|4|4|1|-1|cell-bborder|2ln>|<cwith|4|4|1|1|cell-lborder|0ln>|<cwith|4|4|4|4|cell-rborder|0ln>|<cwith|2|2|1|-1|cell-tborder|1ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-bborder|1ln>|<cwith|3|3|1|-1|cell-bborder|1ln>|<cwith|4|4|1|-1|cell-tborder|1ln>|<cwith|2|3|1|1|cell-lborder|0ln>|<cwith|2|3|4|4|cell-rborder|0ln>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-bsep|0.5fn>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-tsep|0.5fn>|<table|<row|<\cell>
      Cell with text allgned to the left
    </cell>|<\cell>
      1
    </cell>|<\cell>
      2
    </cell>|<\cell>
      3
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      4
    </cell>|<\cell>
      Cell with justified text
    </cell>|<\cell>
      5
    </cell>|<\cell>
      6
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      7
    </cell>|<\cell>
      8
    </cell>|<\cell>
      Cell with centered text
    </cell>|<\cell>
      9
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      10
    </cell>|<\cell>
      11
    </cell>|<\cell>
      12
    </cell>|<\cell>
      Cell with text aligned to the right
    </cell>>>>><label|table:2-3>>
      同页宽的表格实例
    </big-table>

    如果表格横向宽度不够，在x00;格式\<rightarrow\>变换\<rightarrow\>旋转x00;，设定旋转度数，如表table:2-4所示。

    <small-table|<tabular|<tformat|<table|<row|<cell|<rotate|270|<tformat|<cwith|1|1|1|2|cell-tborder|1ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|2|cell-bborder|1ln>|<cwith|2|2|1|2|cell-tborder|1ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|1|cell-lborder|0ln>|<cwith|1|1|2|2|cell-rborder|0ln>|<cwith|6|6|1|2|cell-tborder|0ln>|<cwith|5|5|1|2|cell-bborder|0ln>|<cwith|6|6|1|2|cell-bborder|1ln>|<cwith|6|6|1|1|cell-lborder|0ln>|<cwith|6|6|2|2|cell-rborder|0ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|2|cell-height|2em>|<cwith|1|1|1|2|cell-vmode|exact>|<cwith|2|6|1|2|cell-height|2em>|<cwith|2|6|1|2|cell-vmode|exact>|<cwith|1|6|1|2|cell-valign|c>|<table|<row|<cell|文件名>|<cell|描述>>|<row|<cell|thuthesis.dtx>|<cell|模板的源文件，包括文档和注释>>|<row|<cell|thuthesis.cls>|<cell|模板文件>>|<row|<cell|thuthesis-*.bst>|<cell|BibTeX 参考文献表样式文件>>|<row|<cell|thuthesis-*.bbx>|<cell|BibLaTeX 参考文献表样式文件>>|<row|<cell|thuthesis-*.cbx>|<cell|BibLaTeX 引用样式文件>>>>>>|<cell|>>>>><label|table:2-4>|旋转90度的三线表示例>
